        {
          "id": "ffc093fc-4153-3c1c-b38a-af20efe4fbe7",
          "content": {
            "id": "ffc093fc-4153-3c1c-b38a-af20efe4fbe7",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Retail stocks slide, Tilray Brands earnings, Mattel downgrade",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination Host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> and Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/\">Brooke DiPalma</a> take a closer look at some of the trending tickers during Friday's session.</p>\n<p>Retail stocks, like Under Armour (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UAA\">UAA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UA\">UA</a>), Kohl's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/KSS\">KSS</a>), and Lululemon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LULU\">LULU</a>), fell after the US Supreme Court didn't release a final ruling on President Trump's tariff policies that was expected on Friday.</p>\n<p>Tilray Brands (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TLRY\">TLRY</a>) stock is in focus following the cannabis company's second quarter earnings results.</p>\n<p>Goldman downgrades its rating on Mattel stock (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MAT\">MAT</a>) to Neutral.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Market Domination Host Josh Lipton and Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter Brooke DiPalma take a closer look at some of the trending tickers during Friday's session. Retail stocks, like Under Armour (UAA, UA), Kohl's (KSS), and Lululemon (LULU), fell after the US Supreme Court didn't release a final ruling on President Trump's tariff policies that was expected on Friday. Tilray Brands (TLRY) stock is in focus following the cannabis company's second quarter earnings results. Goldman downgrades its rating on Mattel stock (MAT) to Neutral. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination.",
